        "description": "A voice AI agent (built on Vocal Bridge) that calls travelers directly to deliver trip updates, answer questions about their itinerary, and handle vendor payments with real flight/hotel data, live weather, and persistent memory backing every call. The backend relies on Node.js utilizing native node:sqlite for lightweight, zero-service data persistence across calls. Sabre MCP tools, PayPal Sandbox, and real-time weather APIs power live travel capabilities, payment flows, and environmental context. Additionally, a secure, size- and type-restricted Express endpoint manages travel document uploads like passport scans and itineraries, giving the agent full context during conversations."
